{
  "name": "2 - End of Call Logging and Escalation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - SETUP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 600,
        "height": 400,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## SETUP\n\n**What this does:** every time a call ends, Vapi posts the full transcript here. This workflow works out how the call went, writes it to Airtable, and emails you if a human needs to step in.\n\n**Credentials to attach:**\n- `Vapi Webhook Secret` - same Header Auth credential as Workflow 1.\n- `Google Gemini API` - your existing credential.\n- `AI GMAIL` - your existing Gmail credential.\n- `Airtable Personal Access Token (Receptionist)` - same as Workflow 1.\n\n**Two things to fill in:**\n1. `Send Escalation Alert` node ? set **To** to your own email address (currently a placeholder).\n2. Every Airtable node ? pick your real base and the **Interaction Log** table (placeholders right now).\n\n**Model choice:** classification is a cheap task, so this uses a Flash model. Swap it in the node's dropdown if you'd rather match what your other workflows use.\n\n**Replaces the old missed-call text-back.** Since Twilio won't give us a free number, a call that fails or gets abandoned is caught here and emailed to you instead of texted to the caller."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Classify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 480,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 2 - Work out how the call went\nGemini reads the transcript and decides: was it booked, cancelled, a message, or does a human need to ring them back? If Gemini itself fails, the call is marked 'Unclear' and flagged for you - never silently dropped."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Escalate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1660,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 900,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 3 - Tell a human when it matters\nAn email goes out when the AI couldn't finish the job, the caller asked for a person, or the call dropped/errored. Everything else just gets logged quietly."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2620,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 4 - Log everything\nEvery call lands in the Interaction Log table, whether it escalated or not. This is the record you'd show a client."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Receive End of Call Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "voice-end-of-call",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Is End-Of-Call Report?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -100,
        300
